"""Create only planned metadata records; this does not prepare or launch a compute process."""
from pathlib import Path
import json,os
p=Path(__file__).resolve().parent
request=json.loads((p/'preparation_request.json').read_bytes())
def write(name,value):
 raw=(json.dumps(value,sort_keys=True,indent=2)+'\n').encode() if not isinstance(value,str) else value.encode()
 with (p/name).open('xb') as stream:stream.write(raw);stream.flush();os.fsync(stream.fileno())
manifest={k:request[k] for k in ['schema_version','kind','state','packet','data_unit','campaign_run_dir','unit_id','helper_source_commit','helper_source_root','helper_checkout_verified','numerical_source_root','numerical_source_commit','shape','scientific_credit','case_credit','idea_credit','worker_admitted','admission_granted']}
manifest['git']={'commit':request['helper_source_commit'],'checkout_verified':False,'dirty':None}
write('manifest.yaml',manifest)
write('config_resolved.yaml',{'candidate':request['configuration'],'reference':request['configuration'],'runtime_environment':request['runtime_environment'],'shape':request['shape'],'asset_record':request['asset_record']})
write('command.txt','/usr/bin/python3 -I -B '+str(p/'prepare_direct_qualification_metadata.py')+'\n')
write('experiment_background.md',"## Purpose\n\nPrepare a separate full-original H100 qualification on the approved physical card of serval02. This packet currently contains metadata only. It grants no scientific or worker admission credit and makes no server contact.\n\n## Key hyperparameters\n\nOne independent policy uses 128 pixel environments, 128 rollout steps, four optimization epochs and four minibatches. The normalization warmup uses fifty full random rollouts and the controlled reference uses one update with seed one. Networks and optimizer state use float32; running statistics use float64. The known physical card is an H100 NVL with driver 590.48.01 and 95,830 mebibytes. The actual current CUDA context, identifier, address and minor must be proved by the future child. No process identity is supplied at preparation. All forty-eight original test definitions, thirty-three rooms, 132 renderer variants and eleven synthetic pixel cases remain required.\n\n## Code and config changes\n\nUse the separately reviewed direct binding and assigned-device observer. Preserve the original configuration and numerical source. Before any future contact, rederive every original comparison and exact exit from the 646 captured original payloads. A future actual parent must synchronize the current child identifier, birth and launch ledger before numerical work; the child refuses missing launch metadata before importing its numerical runtime. Retain the standing descriptor through actual child exit and record the real parent wait return. The post-context device check keeps used memory below 1,024 mebibytes and at least fifteen percent actual free memory. Pre-context occupancy and startup memory peaks remain unobserved. No accepted combined baseline, completed-fifty proof or previous direct qualification is required. No process is launched by this metadata command.\n\n## Git state\n\nPublished helper commit: `"+request['helper_source_commit']+"`. Numerical source: `"+request['numerical_source_commit']+"`. The new detached helper checkout has not yet been prepared or verified; its actual clean-source receipt is required before launch. The integration checkout and its existing records remain unchanged.\n")
